Description:
  Social Media: the profiles this person keeps elsewhere.

  One of the three pages under the Profile pop-out. The platforms and their order come from
  SocialPlatform, never from this markup, so adding a thirteenth platform is one line in the
  catalogue rather than a template edit that has to agree with a validator somewhere else.

  Every field may be left empty, and emptying one removes the link. There is no delete control per
  row because there is nothing a delete control would do that clearing the field does not.

  Comments here are plain prose only: no angle brackets, no comment delimiters and no template
  tokens.
Changelog:
  2026/09/10 02:25 SAST
  - Created as one of the three Profile pages.
